{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unsynchronized","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unsynchronized","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLSync.Kind.unsynchronized","roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLSyncV4KindO14unsynchronizedyA2EmF"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/unsynchronized","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"No synchronization to the performer."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/unsynchronized"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum/unsynchronized":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/unsynchronized","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"No synchronization to the performer."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind.unsynchronized","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/unsynchronized","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unsynchronized"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sync-type type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accompaniment with a performer. The none type indicates no synchronization to the performer. The tempo type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates synchronization based on the performer tempo rather than individual events in the score. The event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type indicates synchronization by following the performance of individual events in the score rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the performer tempo. The mostly-tempo and mostly-event types combine these two approaches, with mostly-tempo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"giving more weight to tempo and mostly-event giving more weight to performed events. The always-event type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provides the strictest synchronization by not being forgiving of missing performed events."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLSync.Kind","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The sync type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accompaniment with a performer. If this type is not included in a score, default synchronization depends on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the application.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync","type":"topic","title":"MXLSync","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","kind":"symbol"}}}